<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comerci cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Alejandro Daniel Lerner said on Friday he had reduced his rating for Mexican retailer Controladora Comercial Mexicana SA, or Comerci, to underperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- In a report, the analyst said Comerci had canceled its joint venture with France's Groupe Auchan &quot;unexpectedly after just 19 months - we view this negatively.</p>
<p>-- &quot;CCM acquires Kmart (Corp) Mexico hypermarket business for $149 million - we estimate external financing will be required and we are concerned with the purchase price.&quot;</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in Comerci were off 5/8 to 18-1/2 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
